---
import ComicCampaignLayout from "@layouts/ComicCampaignLayout.astro";
---

<ComicCampaignLayout
  title="Phones Ringing. Files Piling Up. Clients Waiting. | Attorney Assistant"
  description="We rescue your attorneys from admin so they can get back to lawyering. We do staffing. Deploy Attorney Assistant."
  image="/images/lp/law-firm-chaos-header.jpg"
>

  <section class="cmc-hero relative overflow-hidden min-h-[60vh] md:min-h-[70vh] flex items-center">
    <!-- Background image -->
    <picture class="absolute inset-0 z-0 block">
      <source srcset="/images/lp/law-firm-chaos-header.webp" type="image/webp" />
      <img src="/images/lp/law-firm-chaos-header.jpg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="w-full h-full object-cover" width="1920" height="1080" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" />
    </picture>
    <!-- Slight dark overlay for text legibility -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-[1]" aria-hidden="true" style="background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(10,22,40,0.55) 0%, rgba(10,22,40,0.55) 60%, rgba(10,22,40,1) 100%);"></div>
    <!-- Atmospheric glow orbs (above the overlay) -->
    <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/4 w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-brand-gold/[0.06] rounded-full blur-[150px] z-[2]" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-1/4 w-[400px] h-[400px] bg-brand-blue/[0.05] rounded-full blur-[120px] z-[2]" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <div class="comic-container relative z-10 py-16 md:py-24 w-full">
      <div class="text-center reveal">
        <h1 class="comic-title text-4xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl text-white leading-none mb-4" style="text-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(10,22,40,0.85);">
          Phones ringing. Files piling up. <br/><span class="comic-gold">We rescue law firms with elite staffing + AI solutions.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="comic-sub text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-100 font-semibold max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8" style="text-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(10,22,40,0.8);">
          Clients waiting. Staff overwhelmed. The owner holding it all together with willpower. Sound familiar?
        </p>
        <a href="#book-now" class="clfc-btn clfc-btn--gold group inline-flex">Deploy Attorney Assistant <svg class="w-5 h-5 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M3 10a.75.75 0 01.75-.75h10.638L10.23 5.29a.75.75 0 111.04-1.08l5.5 5.25a.75.75 0 010 1.08l-5.5 5.25a.75.75 0 11-1.04-1.08l4.158-3.96H3.75A.75.75 0 013 10z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="relative py-20 md:py-28 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-red-500/[0.04] rounded-full blur-[120px]"></div>
    <div class="comic-container relative z-10">
      <div class="text-center mb-14">
        <span class="comic-pow comic-pow--red mb-4 inline-block">THE TIMELINE!</span>
        <h2 class="comic-section-title mb-4">A Day Inside <span class="comic-gold">the Chaos</span></h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto">This isn't a bad day. It's every day.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
        <div class="comic-panel clfc-timeline-panel reveal"><div class="clfc-panel-header clfc-panel-header--gold"><span class="clfc-panel-num">01</span><span class="clfc-panel-day">8:30 AM</span></div><div class="p-5"><h3 class="comic-title text-xl text-white mb-2">47 Emails. 6 Voicemails.</h3><p class="text-sm text-gray-400">Three are urgent. Two are from clients you forgot to call back. One is a deadline nobody flagged.</p></div></div>
        <div class="comic-panel clfc-timeline-panel reveal" style="transition-delay:100ms"><div class="clfc-panel-header clfc-panel-header--amber"><span class="clfc-panel-num">02</span><span class="clfc-panel-day">10:00 AM</span></div><div class="p-5"><span class="comic-pow comic-pow--amber text-xs mb-2 inline-block">CHAOS!</span><h3 class="comic-title text-xl text-white mb-2">Everyone Needs You</h3><p class="text-sm text-gray-400">Paralegal has a question. Client on hold. Attorney needs a file that hasn't been opened yet. You're the bottleneck for everything.</p></div></div>
        <div class="comic-panel clfc-timeline-panel reveal" style="transition-delay:200ms"><div class="clfc-panel-header clfc-panel-header--red"><span class="clfc-panel-num">03</span><span class="clfc-panel-day">1:00 PM</span></div><div class="p-5"><span class="comic-pow comic-pow--red text-xs mb-2 inline-block">CRISIS!</span><h3 class="comic-title text-xl text-white mb-2">A Deadline Almost Blows</h3><p class="text-sm text-gray-400">SOL filing due today. Nobody flagged it. You catch it by accident. Crisis averted — this time.</p></div></div>
        <div class="comic-panel clfc-timeline-panel reveal" style="transition-delay:300ms"><div class="clfc-panel-header clfc-panel-header--red"><span class="clfc-panel-num">04</span><span class="clfc-panel-day">4:00 PM</span></div><div class="p-5"><span class="comic-pow comic-pow--red text-xs mb-2 inline-block">BURNED!</span><h3 class="comic-title text-xl text-white mb-2">Zero Legal Work Done</h3><p class="text-sm text-gray-400">The entire day was spent putting out fires, chasing people, and checking everyone else's work. Again.</p></div></div>
        <div class="comic-panel clfc-timeline-panel md:col-span-2 lg:col-span-2 reveal" style="transition-delay:400ms"><div class="clfc-panel-header clfc-panel-header--gold"><span class="clfc-panel-num">05</span><span class="clfc-panel-day">Every Day</span></div><div class="p-6"><span class="comic-pow comic-pow--gold text-sm mb-3 inline-block">KA-BOOM!</span><h3 class="comic-title text-2xl md:text-3xl comic-gold mb-2">The Chaos Isn't Caused by Bad People. It's Caused by No Structure.</h3><p class="text-base text-gray-400">No SOPs. No delegation. No one owning the operational backbone. That's what we fix.</p></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="relative py-20 md:py-28 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-[#111b2e]/50 to-transparent"></div>
    <div class="comic-container relative z-10">
      <div class="text-center mb-14 reveal">
        <span class="comic-pow comic-pow--amber mb-4 inline-block">CHOOSE!</span>
        <h2 class="comic-section-title mb-4">Where's the Chaos <span class="comic-gold">Hitting Hardest?</span></h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-4xl mx-auto" id="clfc-paths">
        <button class="cmc-path-card reveal" data-path="admin"><span class="comic-pow comic-pow--red text-xs mb-3 inline-block">POW!</span><h3 class="comic-title text-2xl text-white mb-2">Admin Overload</h3><p class="text-sm text-gray-400">Filing, scheduling, data entry — the back office is a bottleneck.</p></button>
        <button class="cmc-path-card reveal" data-path="leads" style="transition-delay:100ms"><span class="comic-pow comic-pow--amber text-xs mb-3 inline-block">BAM!</span><h3 class="comic-title text-2xl text-white mb-2">Leads Leaking</h3><p class="text-sm text-gray-400">Calls missed, follow-up late, cases slipping through the cracks.</p></button>
        <button class="cmc-path-card reveal" data-path="owner" style="transition-delay:200ms"><span class="comic-pow comic-pow--blue text-xs mb-3 inline-block">ZAP!</span><h3 class="comic-title text-2xl text-white mb-2">I'm the System</h3><p class="text-sm text-gray-400">If I step away, things fall apart. I can't take a day off.</p></button>
      </div>

      <div id="clfc-consequence" class="max-w-2xl mx-auto mt-10" style="display:none">
        <div class="comic-panel p-8 text-center" style="border-color: rgba(249,166,45,0.4);">
          <p class="comic-eyebrow mb-3" id="clfc-consequence-label"></p>
          <p class="comic-title text-2xl md:text-3xl text-white mb-3" id="clfc-consequence-title"></p>
          <p class="text-base text-gray-400 leading-relaxed" id="clfc-consequence-body"></p>
          <a href="#book-now" class="clfc-btn clfc-btn--gold group inline-flex mt-6">Deploy the Fix <svg class="w-5 h-5 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M3 10a.75.75 0 01.75-.75h10.638L10.23 5.29a.75.75 0 111.04-1.08l5.5 5.25a.75.75 0 010 1.08l-5.5 5.25a.75.75 0 11-1.04-1.08l4.158-3.96H3.75A.75.75 0 013 10z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="relative py-20 md:py-28 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute top-20 right-0 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-brand-gold/[0.06] rounded-full blur-[120px]"></div>
    <div class="comic-container relative z-10">
      <div class="text-center mb-14 reveal"><span class="comic-pow comic-pow--blue mb-4 inline-block">VS!</span><h2 class="comic-section-title mb-4">Chaos <span class="comic-gold">vs. Control</span></h2></div>

      <div class="flex justify-center mb-10 reveal">
        <div class="inline-flex rounded-lg border-2 border-white/15 bg-white/5 p-1">
          <button class="cmc-toggle cmc-toggle--active" id="clfc-toggle-before"><span class="comic-pow comic-pow--red text-[10px] mr-1.5">&#10005;</span> The Chaos</button>
          <button class="cmc-toggle" id="clfc-toggle-after"><span class="comic-pow comic-pow--gold text-[10px] mr-1.5">&#10003;</span> With Us</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="clfc-panel-before" class="clfc-compare-panel max-w-4xl mx-auto reveal">
        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div class="cmc-item cmc-item--bad"><span class="cmc-item-icon cmc-item-icon--red">&#10005;</span><div><p class="text-white font-bold text-sm comic-sub">No SOPs or processes</p><p class="text-white/40 text-xs mt-0.5">Everyone does things differently. Training is "figure it out."</p></div></div>
          <div class="cmc-item cmc-item--bad"><span class="cmc-item-icon cmc-item-icon--red">&#10005;</span><div><p class="text-white font-bold text-sm comic-sub">Owner does everything</p><p class="text-white/40 text-xs mt-0.5">Can't delegate because there's nobody reliable to delegate to</p></div></div>
          <div class="cmc-item cmc-item--bad"><span class="cmc-item-icon cmc-item-icon--red">&#10005;</span><div><p class="text-white font-bold text-sm comic-sub">Fires all day, every day</p><p class="text-white/40 text-xs mt-0.5">Reactive mode from 8AM to 8PM. No time for strategy.</p></div></div>
          <div class="cmc-item cmc-item--bad"><span class="cmc-item-icon cmc-item-icon--red">&#10005;</span><div><p class="text-white font-bold text-sm comic-sub">Staff overwhelmed</p><p class="text-white/40 text-xs mt-0.5">Good people drowning in bad systems. Turnover is constant.</p></div></div>
          <div class="cmc-item cmc-item--bad"><span class="cmc-item-icon cmc-item-icon--red">&#10005;</span><div><p class="text-white font-bold text-sm comic-sub">Revenue plateau</p><p class="text-white/40 text-xs mt-0.5">Can't grow because operations can't support more volume</p></div></div>
          <div class="cmc-item cmc-item--bad"><span class="cmc-item-icon cmc-item-icon--red">&#10005;</span><div><p class="text-white font-bold text-sm comic-sub">Clients feel the dysfunction</p><p class="text-white/40 text-xs mt-0.5">Slow responses, lost documents, missed updates</p></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="clfc-panel-after" class="clfc-compare-panel max-w-4xl mx-auto" style="display:none">
        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div class="cmc-item cmc-item--good"><span class="cmc-item-icon cmc-item-icon--green">&#10003;</span><div><p class="text-white font-bold text-sm comic-sub">Systems and structure</p><p class="text-white/40 text-xs mt-0.5">Documented workflows, clear ownership, repeatable processes</p></div></div>
          <div class="cmc-item cmc-item--good"><span class="cmc-item-icon cmc-item-icon--green">&#10003;</span><div><p class="text-white font-bold text-sm comic-sub">Owner leads, doesn't babysit</p><p class="text-white/40 text-xs mt-0.5">Delegation works because the ops backbone holds</p></div></div>
          <div class="cmc-item cmc-item--good"><span class="cmc-item-icon cmc-item-icon--green">&#10003;</span><div><p class="text-white font-bold text-sm comic-sub">Proactive, not reactive</p><p class="text-white/40 text-xs mt-0.5">Issues caught before they become crises</p></div></div>
          <div class="cmc-item cmc-item--good"><span class="cmc-item-icon cmc-item-icon--green">&#10003;</span><div><p class="text-white font-bold text-sm comic-sub">Trained, managed team</p><p class="text-white/40 text-xs mt-0.5">VAs embedded in your workflow, managed by legal ops experts</p></div></div>
          <div class="cmc-item cmc-item--good"><span class="cmc-item-icon cmc-item-icon--green">&#10003;</span><div><p class="text-white font-bold text-sm comic-sub">Capacity to grow</p><p class="text-white/40 text-xs mt-0.5">Operations scale with volume. More cases, same calm.</p></div></div>
          <div class="cmc-item cmc-item--good"><span class="cmc-item-icon cmc-item-icon--green">&#10003;</span><div><p class="text-white font-bold text-sm comic-sub">Clients feel the difference</p><p class="text-white/40 text-xs mt-0.5">Fast responses, organized files, proactive updates</p></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="relative py-16 md:py-24 overflow-hidden" id="book-now">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-[#111b2e] to-[#0a1628]"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-0 inset-x-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-brand-gold/30 to-transparent"></div>
    <div class="comic-container relative z-10">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <div class="text-center mb-10 reveal">
          <span class="comic-pow comic-pow--gold text-lg mb-4 inline-block px-6 py-1">DEPLOY!</span>
          <h2 class="comic-section-title mb-4">End the <span class="comic-gold">Chaos</span></h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-400 max-w-xl mx-auto">Book a quick call. We'll diagnose what's broken and build the ops backbone your firm is missing.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="comic-panel p-1 reveal scroll-mt-20" style="border-color: rgba(249,166,45,0.3); transition-delay: 150ms"><div class="bg-white rounded-[9px] p-4 md:p-5"><div class="meetings-iframe-container" data-src="https://meet.attorneyassistant.com/meetings/attorney-assistant/comic?embed=true"></div></div></div>
        <div class="flex justify-center gap-6 mt-8 text-sm text-gray-500 reveal" style="transition-delay: 250ms">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-gold" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg> Free &mdash; no commitment</div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-gold" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg> 15 minutes</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <script is:inline>window.__hsGeoReady.then(function(a){if(a){var s=document.createElement("script");s.src="https://static.hsappstatic.net/MeetingsEmbed/ex/MeetingsEmbedCode.js";document.head.appendChild(s)}else{document.querySelectorAll(".meetings-iframe-container").forEach(function(e){e.innerHTML='<div style="padding:2rem;text-align:center;color:#667085;font-size:0.875rem;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);border-radius:0.75rem;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);"><p style="margin:0;color:#94a3b8;">This form is not available from your location.</p></div>'})}});</script>

  <style>
    .meetings-iframe-container iframe{background:#fff!important}.cmc-hero{padding-bottom:0}
    .clfc-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;font-family:'Sora',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:1rem;padding:.875rem 2rem;border-radius:8px;border:none;cursor:pointer;transition:all .3s;text-decoration:none}
    .clfc-btn--gold{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f9a62d,#e8901a);color:#0a1628;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(249,166,45,.3)}.clfc-btn--gold:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(249,166,45,.4)}
    .clfc-timeline-panel{transition:transform .3s,box-shadow .3s}.clfc-timeline-panel:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 12px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}
    .clfc-panel-header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:.75rem 1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08)}
    .clfc-panel-header--gold{background:rgba(249,166,45,.08)}.clfc-panel-header--amber{background:rgba(245,158,11,.08)}.clfc-panel-header--red{background:rgba(239,68,68,.08)}
    .clfc-panel-num{font-family:'Bangers',cursive;font-size:1.5rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,.2)}.clfc-panel-day{font-size:.6875rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:rgba(255,255,255,.4)}
    .clfc-compare-panel{animation:clfcPanelIn .4s ease}@keyframes clfcPanelIn{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}}
    @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.clfc-timeline-panel,.cmc-path-card,.clfc-btn,.cmc-item{transition:none!important}.clfc-compare-panel{animation:none!important}}
  </style>

  <script is:inline>
    (function(){var c={admin:{label:'Admin Avalanche',title:'Your attorneys are spending 15+ hours a week on work that doesn\'t require a law degree.',body:'Filing, scheduling, records, data entry — this work buries your most expensive people in your cheapest tasks. A trained VA handles all of it at a fraction of the cost.'},leads:{label:'Leaking Revenue',title:'Every missed call and late follow-up is a case that signed with someone else.',body:'78% of leads hire the first firm that responds. If your intake is inconsistent, you\'re paying for leads and handing them to competitors. That\'s not a marketing problem — it\'s an operations problem.'},owner:{label:'The Owner Trap',title:'If the firm can\'t run without you checking everything, you don\'t have a business — you have a job you can\'t leave.',body:'You built this firm to have freedom. But without operational structure, delegation fails and you become the single point of failure. We build the backbone so you can step back and lead.'}};document.querySelectorAll('.cmc-path-card').forEach(function(d){d.addEventListener('click',function(){var p=this.dataset.path,x=c[p];if(!x)return;document.querySelectorAll('.cmc-path-card').forEach(function(e){e.classList.remove('cmc-path-card--active')});this.classList.add('cmc-path-card--active');document.getElementById('clfc-consequence-label').textContent=x.label;document.getElementById('clfc-consequence-title').textContent=x.title;document.getElementById('clfc-consequence-body').textContent=x.body;var n=document.getElementById('clfc-consequence');n.style.display='block';n.style.animation='none';n.offsetHeight;n.style.animation='clfcPanelIn 0.4s ease'})});var bb=document.getElementById('clfc-toggle-before'),ab=document.getElementById('clfc-toggle-after'),bp=document.getElementById('clfc-panel-before'),ap=document.getElementById('clfc-panel-after');if(bb&&ab){bb.addEventListener('click',function(){bb.classList.add('cmc-toggle--active');ab.classList.remove('cmc-toggle--active');bp.style.display='block';ap.style.display='none';bp.style.animation='none';bp.offsetHeight;bp.style.animation='clfcPanelIn 0.4s ease'});ab.addEventListener('click',function(){ab.classList.add('cmc-toggle--active');bb.classList.remove('cmc-toggle--active');ap.style.display='block';bp.style.display='none';ap.style.animation='none';ap.offsetHeight;ap.style.animation='clfcPanelIn 0.4s ease'})}})();
  </script>

  <script is:inline>
        window.dataLayer=window.dataLayer||[];window.dataLayer.push({event:'lp_view',lp_name:'comic-law-firm-chaos'});
  </script>

</ComicCampaignLayout>
